# Markdown mode draws the lines but point's rendered, with their markup
# hidden. A click on such a line puts point on the character clicked in
# the text, though the line is then drawn as source: in "bold" of
# **bold**, before the CJK 粗 of **粗**, before "task" of a task item
# drawn as a box, and in *one* of a heading. C-c C-x C-x checks the
# task, and C-c C-a aligns the table clicked in, keeping point in the
# cell it was in. The window shows UTF-8 in either locale.
# locales: C C.UTF-8
down x alt
text x
up x alt
sleep 200
text markdown-mode
down Return
sleep 400
click 1 8
sleep 300
text X
sleep 300
click 2 5
sleep 300
text W
sleep 300
click 3 4
sleep 300
text Y
sleep 200
down c ctrl
up c ctrl
down x ctrl
up x ctrl
down x ctrl
up x ctrl
sleep 300
click 0 6
sleep 300
text Z
sleep 300
click 6 3
sleep 300
down c ctrl
up c ctrl
down a ctrl
up a ctrl
sleep 300
text @
